-# Mockup: #/t/invites, design/mockup-src/js-expanded/30-isg.js `vInv`.
- content_for :title, 'Zaproszenia'

%section.gh-panel.gh-page-header
  .gh-page-header-text
    %h1.gh-h1 Zaproszenia
    %p.gh-lead
      Kod ma 6 znaków bez mylących liter (bez O, 0, I, 1 i L).
      Studenci wpisują go w „Dołącz do grupy” albo skanują kod QR.

  = link_to new_story_group_invite_path(@story_group), class: 'gh-btn',
    data: { turbo_frame: 'modal' } do
    %i.fa-solid.fa-plus
    Nowe zaproszenie

%section.gh-panel.gh-invite-list
  -# A header for the grid below, not a <thead>: the rows are grid rows so they
  -# can reflow into a two-column stack on a phone, where this is hidden.
  .gh-invite-row.gh-invite-row--header{ 'aria-hidden': 'true' }
    %span Kod
    %span Status
    %span Użycia
    %span Ważność
    %span

  - if @active.any?
    = render partial: 'invite_row', collection: @active, as: :invite,
      locals: { fresh_id: @fresh_invite_id }
  - else
    %p.gh-explainer-note Brak aktywnych zaproszeń. Utwórz nowe, żeby studenci mogli dołączyć.

-# Folded away rather than mixed in: a dead code is history, and the teacher
-# came here to look at the live ones. Gone entirely when there are none —
-# an empty disclosure is worse than no disclosure.
- if @inactive.any?
  %details.gh-inactive-invites
    %summary= "Nieaktywne (#{@inactive.size}): wygasłe i wyczerpane"
    %section.gh-panel.gh-invite-list
      = render partial: 'invite_row', collection: @inactive, as: :invite
